{"diagnosis": "Fetch test of 256 NOPs reports TRAP: no progress max_addr=0x00000000 and tohost FAIL 0xdead with CYCLES=2009 instead of advancing fetch. Expected max_addr to progress past 0x00000000. Root cause in excerpt is line 1408 set_mem_do_wdata = 1 holding the write-data strobe high every cycle like the two clear lines above it, blocking the mem handshake so fetch never advances.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -1405,7 +1405,7 @@
 		reg_out <= 'bx;
 		set_mem_do_rinst = 0;
 		set_mem_do_rdata = 0;
-		set_mem_do_wdata = 1;
+		set_mem_do_wdata = 0;

 		alu_out_0_q <= alu_out_0;
 		alu_out_q <= alu_out;
", "expected": "tohost PASS (not FAIL 0xdead), TRAP: no progress cleared, max_addr advances beyond 0x00000000"}

